WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:33.416
In the previous verses,
Lord Krishna had described

2
00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:36.125
His boundless love for His devotees.

3
00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:37.541
Now in this verse,

4
00:00:37.541 --> 00:00:40.666
moving toward deeper divine
knowledge, He explains –

5
00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:42.041
through the worship of the devas,

6
00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:45.000
the supreme goal of liberation cannot be attained.

7
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.041
He clarifies

8
00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:48.291
His unique position.

9
00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:49.125
He alone

10
00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:51.000
is the ultimate enjoyer and master

11
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.500
of all yajnas and actions.

12
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.250
This verse sheds light on the consequences

13
00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.583
of not understanding Lord
Krishna's divine nature.

14
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:06.333
Lord Krishna says

15
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:07.625
that He alone is

16
00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:09.875
the true enjoyer of all yajnas and offerings,

17
00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:11.916
and the supreme master.

18
00:01:11.916 --> 00:01:13.416
Even in the yajnas

19
00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:14.625
performed for the devas,

20
00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:17.125
Lord Krishna through those forms holds

21
00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:19.916
the power to grant their fruits.

22
00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:22.375
But one who without understanding His

23
00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:26.250
supreme position performs such worship,

24
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:30.083
their worship is considered incorrect.

25
00:01:30.083 --> 00:01:32.583
The consequence of such ignorance is

26
00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:35.791
returning to the cycle of birth and death.

27
00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:37.875
Those who through the worship of the devas

28
00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:40.500
focus on material gain or heavenly pleasure,

29
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.708
such temporary goals,

30
00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:45.166
they directly Lord Krishna

31
00:01:45.166 --> 00:01:47.708
lose the opportunity to connect.

32
00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:48.958
In the coming verses, Lord Krishna

33
00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:50.500
will also clarify

34
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:54.250
how His devotees attain
the supreme destination,

35
00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:56.458
while those who walk on other paths

36
00:01:56.458 --> 00:01:59.500
remain trapped in material bondage.

37
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:03.208
This falling down or remaining
trapped in material bondage

38
00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:05.958
happens because their worship

39
00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:09.083
cannot move in the direction 
of the ultimate truth.

40
00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:10.250
Lord Krishna explains

41
00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:11.458
that even while

42
00:02:11.458 --> 00:02:14.000
worshipping other forms or devas,

43
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.041
recognising Him as supreme is essential,

44
00:02:18.041 --> 00:02:22.208
so that one can be freed from
material existence.

45
00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:24.958
Lord Krishna's divine nature, fully

46
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:27.875
understanding it and worshipping Him directly

47
00:02:27.875 --> 00:02:30.333
leads to eternal results,

48
00:02:30.333 --> 00:02:32.375
whereas the worship of the devas alone

49
00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:35.250
gives temporary benefit.

50
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.458
Lord Krishna compares this ignorance

51
00:02:37.458 --> 00:02:41.125
to misplaced focus.

52
00:02:41.125 --> 00:02:42.291
Imagine

53
00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:46.750
that someone works hard to earn money,

54
00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:47.833
but spends it

55
00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:50.333
only on momentary pleasures,

56
00:02:50.333 --> 00:02:53.500
without securing their lasting future.

57
00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:54.541
In the same way,

58
00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:58.041
the worship of the devas
may give temporary results,

59
00:02:58.041 --> 00:03:02.333
but it does not lead to the
eternal spiritual destination.

60
00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:04.250
Lord Krishna emphasises

61
00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.250
that understanding Him in truth – tattvena –

62
00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.666
and worshipping Him

63
00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:12.250
is the key to transcending material existence.

64
00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.666
In this verse, Lord Krishna repeats

65
00:03:14.666 --> 00:03:16.500
the central theme of the Gita –

66
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.833
all activities

67
00:03:17.833 --> 00:03:19.291
and yajnas

68
00:03:19.291 --> 00:03:22.125
must ultimately be directed toward Him.

69
00:03:22.125 --> 00:03:24.500
Recognising Lord Krishna as
the source, the enjoyer,

70
00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.583
and the master of all

71
00:03:26.583 --> 00:03:29.875
is essential to attain liberation.

72
00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:32.000
Anything less than this

73
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.541
yields only temporary rewards

74
00:03:35.541 --> 00:03:38.125
and becomes the cause of returning

75
00:03:38.125 --> 00:03:40.125
to the cycle of life and death.

76
00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.250
Have you ever thought

77
00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.125
about what the true source

78
00:03:50.125 --> 00:03:53.916
of all the successes in your life

79
00:03:53.916 --> 00:03:56.041
truly is?

80
00:03:56.041 --> 00:03:58.958
When you forget

81
00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:02.208
that whatever you have,

82
00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:04.541
its source

83
00:04:04.541 --> 00:04:06.166
is Me,

84
00:04:06.166 --> 00:04:10.958
then you begin to believe that all your successes

85
00:04:10.958 --> 00:04:15.166
are the result of your own efforts alone.

86
00:04:15.166 --> 00:04:19.041
This mindset

87
00:04:19.041 --> 00:04:21.750
gives birth to ego

88
00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:25.083
and a sense of entitlement,

89
00:04:25.083 --> 00:04:28.708
and when life does not go your way,

90
00:04:28.708 --> 00:04:32.333
dissatisfaction follows.

91
00:04:32.333 --> 00:04:34.000
Just as without

92
00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.333
fire food cannot be cooked,

93
00:04:37.333 --> 00:04:40.125
in the same way without Me

94
00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:44.666
your talents too remain fruitless.

95
00:04:44.666 --> 00:04:48.166
Think – intelligence, opportunity,

96
00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:51.208
and the strength to act –

97
00:04:51.208 --> 00:04:53.875
who gives all this?

98
00:04:53.875 --> 00:04:55.500
All of this

99
00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:59.666
is connected to Me alone.

100
00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:03.208
When you recognise My role,

101
00:05:03.208 --> 00:05:04.916
your heart

102
00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:09.625
naturally fills with gratitude.

103
00:05:09.625 --> 00:05:11.250
And this gratitude

104
00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.875
even in challenging times

105
00:05:13.875 --> 00:05:17.541
brings peace and contentment.

106
00:05:17.541 --> 00:05:20.958
But when you try to make yourself

107
00:05:20.958 --> 00:05:26.333
the centre of all your activities,

108
00:05:26.333 --> 00:05:29.500
then life becomes a burden.

109
00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:34.375
You cannot control every situation,

110
00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:37.708
and this false sense of ownership

111
00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:40.708
becomes the cause of stress
and disappointment.

112
00:05:40.708 --> 00:05:43.416
Live with gratitude.

113
00:05:43.416 --> 00:05:45.875
In every aspect of your life

114
00:05:45.875 --> 00:05:47.750
acknowledge Me.

115
00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:52.500
This outlook will not only
elevate your awareness, but

116
00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.958
will also free you

117
00:05:53.958 --> 00:05:55.666
from the endless cycle

118
00:05:55.666 --> 00:05:57.625
of frustration and restlessness.

119
00:05:57.625 --> 00:06:01.375
By connecting with Me, you will find true joy

120
00:06:01.375 --> 00:06:04.125
and fulfilment.

121
00:06:04.125 --> 00:06:07.750
One who sees Me everywhere,

122
00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:11.666
he comes to know the real secret of life

123
00:06:11.666 --> 00:06:16.208
and attains infinite peace.

124
00:06:20.958 --> 00:06:24.625
Flowing through the current of life,

125
00:06:24.625 --> 00:06:28.916
you often forget

126
00:06:28.916 --> 00:06:32.875
what the foundation of your relationships is.

127
00:06:32.875 --> 00:06:34.916
In family life,

128
00:06:34.916 --> 00:06:38.458
when you forget

129
00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:42.000
that I am the supreme provider,

130
00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:46.375
then relationships become strained.

131
00:06:46.375 --> 00:06:50.375
You begin to undervalue each other

132
00:06:50.375 --> 00:06:54.166
or only focus on material gain,

133
00:06:54.166 --> 00:06:59.583
believing that these are
the only sources of joy.

134
00:06:59.583 --> 00:07:04.375
Just as the roots of a tree are not visible,

135
00:07:04.375 --> 00:07:08.625
yet they give life to the entire tree,

136
00:07:08.625 --> 00:07:10.291
in the same way

137
00:07:10.291 --> 00:07:15.500
I am the invisible foundation of your family.

138
00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.791
When families recognise Me

139
00:07:17.791 --> 00:07:19.375
as the source of

140
00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:22.916
all blessings, then gratitude

141
00:07:22.916 --> 00:07:26.500
becomes a natural part of their

142
00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.208
relationships with each other.

143
00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:31.708
Think about the love and support

144
00:07:31.708 --> 00:07:33.958
you share with your family –

145
00:07:33.958 --> 00:07:36.208
about that, think.

146
00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:39.458
For this harmony, the resources –

147
00:07:39.458 --> 00:07:42.458
who provides them?

148
00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:44.708
When a family collectively

149
00:07:44.708 --> 00:07:47.666
acknowledges My presence,

150
00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:50.666
then they create an atmosphere

151
00:07:50.666 --> 00:07:53.750
of service, respect, and gratitude.

152
00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:55.500
But

153
00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:59.458
when you forget My role,

154
00:07:59.458 --> 00:08:01.416
then the mind shifts

155
00:08:01.416 --> 00:08:05.416
toward selfishness and attachment.

156
00:08:05.416 --> 00:08:09.500
This mindset eventually becomes the cause

157
00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:12.208
of dissatisfaction and conflict.

158
00:08:12.208 --> 00:08:15.666
Where people remember Me, there

159
00:08:15.666 --> 00:08:21.291
resentment, envy, and ego come to an end,

160
00:08:21.291 --> 00:08:24.666
and in place of all of them, love

161
00:08:24.666 --> 00:08:27.666
and unity are born.

162
00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:36.458
When your professional efforts succeed,

163
00:08:36.458 --> 00:08:40.041
then truly behind that success

164
00:08:40.041 --> 00:08:41.250
who is there?

165
00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:45.833
At the workplace, when you forget

166
00:08:45.833 --> 00:08:50.333
that I am the supreme source
of all opportunities,

167
00:08:50.333 --> 00:08:54.083
then you begin to take pride in your successes,

168
00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:57.291
believing that they are entirely

169
00:08:57.291 --> 00:09:00.500
the result of your own efforts.

170
00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.458
Remember,

171
00:09:02.458 --> 00:09:05.458
just as a river's water comes from the ocean

172
00:09:05.458 --> 00:09:07.500
and ultimately into the ocean

173
00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:12.583
it merges back, in the same way
all your abilities

174
00:09:12.583 --> 00:09:15.416
come from Me, and ultimately

175
00:09:15.416 --> 00:09:18.041
into Me they merge back.

176
00:09:18.041 --> 00:09:20.666
This mindset of pride

177
00:09:20.666 --> 00:09:24.250
can lead you toward ego, strained relationships,

178
00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.000
and even

179
00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:29.416
unethical behaviour.

180
00:09:29.416 --> 00:09:32.125
This same problem of ego

181
00:09:32.125 --> 00:09:35.750
is visible in the business world too.

182
00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.791
Successful entrepreneurs built

183
00:09:37.791 --> 00:09:41.125
great organisations and
gained great prosperity,

184
00:09:41.125 --> 00:09:43.791
but then, overcome by ego,

185
00:09:43.791 --> 00:09:47.750
they disrespected their colleagues.

186
00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:50.416
They abandoned the ethical path.

187
00:09:50.416 --> 00:09:55.666
As a result, their businesses collapsed.

188
00:09:55.666 --> 00:09:59.916
In contrast, those who worked with humility,

189
00:09:59.916 --> 00:10:02.583
bringing everyone along,

190
00:10:02.583 --> 00:10:06.416
they found continuous success.

191
00:10:06.416 --> 00:10:11.125
Think – the talent, the skills,

192
00:10:11.125 --> 00:10:14.458
and the resources to succeed,

193
00:10:14.458 --> 00:10:16.708
who gave them?

194
00:10:16.708 --> 00:10:19.958
All this is directed by Me,

195
00:10:19.958 --> 00:10:22.583
to make you successful.

196
00:10:22.583 --> 00:10:26.291
When you recognise My presence,

197
00:10:26.291 --> 00:10:29.666
then with humility and gratitude

198
00:10:29.666 --> 00:10:31.500
you work.

199
00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:33.333
Note this,

200
00:10:33.333 --> 00:10:36.833
working with humility does not mean

201
00:10:36.833 --> 00:10:38.583
that you stop

202
00:10:38.583 --> 00:10:40.791
striving for excellence.

203
00:10:40.791 --> 00:10:42.208
It means

204
00:10:42.208 --> 00:10:45.416
that you do your work with a full sense

205
00:10:45.416 --> 00:10:48.208
of responsibility and balance.

206
00:10:48.208 --> 00:10:50.750
When you understand that all

207
00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:53.916
results are in My hands,

208
00:10:53.916 --> 00:10:56.791
then you become free from stress.

209
00:10:56.791 --> 00:11:00.500
But when you forget this and try to control

210
00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:03.666
the outcomes yourself,

211
00:11:03.666 --> 00:11:05.125
then you invite

212
00:11:05.125 --> 00:11:08.000
stress and instability.

213
00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:12.833
Success gained with arrogance is temporary.

214
00:11:12.833 --> 00:11:14.833
By aligning your actions

215
00:11:14.833 --> 00:11:16.916
with My principles,

216
00:11:16.916 --> 00:11:20.208
you ensure lasting success, positivity,

217
00:11:20.208 --> 00:11:22.250
and a workplace

218
00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:25.125
filled with cooperation.
